        "notes": "Applies  spell damage to the primary target (attack target) and  area damage to secondary targets. The passive on-hit damage applies  proc damage.\n Spell shield will not block any damage nor be consumed by the strikes.\nThe true damage is always equal to 150% of the pre-mitigation physical damage.\n Blind will negate the damage to the primary target, but not to any secondary targets.\nPENDING FOR TEST: Interaction with parrying effects ( dodge,  block).\nOnly the last cast of Emberstrike puts Shyvana's basic attack on cooldown.\nIn Human Form, only Q2 will put it on cooldown; in  Dragon Form, only Q3 will.\nThis results in the same functionality as  Leona's  Shield of Daybreak and  Volibear's  Thundering Smash, effectively being a triple/quintuple attack reset.",
